        {
          "name": "Setup Pet (Onboarding)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"user_id\": \"{{user_id}}\",\n    \"pet_name\": \"{{pet_name}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/pet/setup",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "pet", "setup"]
            },
            "description": "Inisialisasi nama pet saat onboarding. Wajib dijalankan sekali sebelum user bisa mencatat aktivitas.\n\n**Logic:**\n- Jika pet belum ada → buat baru dengan `pet_name` dari request (skor 50/50, state `Neutral`).\n- Jika pet sudah ada → hanya update kolom `pet_name`.\n\n**Validasi:**\n- `pet_name` mandatory (kosong → HTTP `400`).\n- `user_id` mandatory (kosong → HTTP `400`)."
          },
