    {
      "name": "Activity",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Activity (Core Loop)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"user_id\": \"{{user_id}}\",\n    \"water_glasses\": 4,\n    \"sleep_hours\": 7.5,\n    \"journal_text\": \"Hari ini aku sangat senang bisa jalan pagi bersama Momo\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/activity",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "activity"]
            },
            "description": "Endpoint inti. Menerima aktivitas harian user, lalu:\n1. Simpan record ke tabel `daily_logs`.\n2. Jalankan **Logic Engine** untuk menghitung skor baru:\n   - `water_glasses >= 4` → `health_score + 15`\n   - `sleep_hours >= 7.0` → `energy_score + 25`\n   - `journal_text` tidak kosong → `health_score + 10`, `energy_score + 10`\n   - Skor di-clamp 0–100.\n3. Tentukan state: `avg >= 75` → `Happy`, `energy < 35` → `Tired`, `health < 40` → `Sad`, selainnya → `Neutral`.\n4. Update tabel `pets`.\n5. Panggil Gemini AI (model `gemini-1.5-flash`, persona Milo) untuk respons empati terhadap state & jurnal. Fallback text disediakan jika API error/rate-limited.\n\n**Prasyarat:** Pet harus sudah di-setup (`POST /api/v1/pet/setup`). Jika belum → HTTP `404`."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n    \"user_id\": \"{{user_id}}\",\n    \"water_glasses\": 4,\n    \"sleep_hours\": 7.5,\n    \"journal_text\": \"Hari ini senang\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/activity",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "activity"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [],
              "body": "{\n    \"status\": \"success\",\n    \"pet\": {\n        \"id\": \"9dc1cff1-faca-4e0b-bde9-b3b63ccfa4c8\",\n        \"user_id\": \"aaaa1111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555\",\n        \"pet_name\": \"Momo\",\n        \"health_score\": 75,\n        \"energy_score\": 85,\n        \"current_state\": \"Happy\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-08-16T00:45:37.305246+07:00\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-08-16T00:45:37.317571+07:00\"\n    },\n    \"ai_message\": \"Milo senang kamu sudah mencatat aktivitas hari ini! Jangan lupa tetap minum air yang cukup dan tidur teratur ya.\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Pet Not Setup Yet",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
